note (added before the step-2 report): the 2 "hits" above are a false positive. Both files contain the
.env value of ECONOCONTEXT_CREDENTIAL_ENV, which is the variable NAME "AGENT_PLATFORM_API_KEY" (where a key
lives), not a key: tests/unit/test_isolation.py lists it as a provider key name, and archive/README-old.md
(the old README, already public at tag econo-jev-final) mentions it. No key value is in any committed file.
The check's failure did not stop the commit because its exit code was lost in a pipe through tee; from
step 3 on the check is scripts/check_secrets.py (exit code respected; values that are only variable names
are skipped and counted).
